{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>From roaming about</b> — like <b>סבוב</b> (going around); and similar to it: <b>שוטטו בחוצות ירושלם</b> (run through the streets of Jerusalem). And the sense of <b>בארץ</b> (on the earth) is in all the world, like: <b>התהלכנו בארץ</b> (we have walked on the earth)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:26.867349058Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}